{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o125a","title":"曹髦驻项遣裴秀钟会随司马昭军","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o125a-account","label":"《三少帝纪》正文","text":"曹髦驻项遣裴秀钟会随司马昭军","evidence":["shaodi-e-o125a-q"]},{"id":"wgc-a-2-e1","label":"正文 · 六月","text":"曹髦车驾东征至项","evidence":["wgc-q0279","wgc-q0028"]},{"id":"wgc-a-5-e25","label":"正文","text":"诞反车驾住项文王至寿春会复从行","evidence":["wgc-q0433","wgc-q0067"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0068","role":"驻项","evidence":["shaodi-e-o125a-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0045","role":"统军","evidence":["shaodi-e-o125a-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0104","role":"随军","evidence":["shaodi-e-o125a-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0073","role":"随军","evidence":["shaodi-e-o125a-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0044","role":"反","evidence":["wgc-q0433","wgc-q0067"]}],"place":{"text":"项","evidence":["shaodi-q-o125"]},"time":{"year":257,"label":"六月甲子","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"shaodi-y257","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"shaodi-q-o117","basis":"六月甲子"},"evidence":["shaodi-e-o125a-q","shaodi-q-o117","shaodi-q-b-6209c552405e0ebbdf98"]},"ordering_evidence":"shaodi-e-o125a-q","source_order":[4,531,"O125a"],"order":1190}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0044","name":"诸葛诞","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0045","name":"司马昭","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0068","name":"曹髦","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0073","name":"钟会","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0104","name":"裴秀","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o125a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-4d6508daae08a729a65a","layer":"original","quote":"甲子〖27〗，诏曰：“今车驾驻项〖28〗。大将军恭行天罚，前临淮浦〖29〗。昔相国、大司马征讨〖30〗，皆与尚书俱行〖31〗。今宜如旧。”乃令散骑常侍裴秀、给事黄门侍郎钟会咸与大将军俱行〖32〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":530,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":98},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-6209c552405e0ebbdf98","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-6209c552405e0ebbdf98","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：甘露二年（公元 257 ）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":535,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-4dd98e402a6a8de51491","start":0,"end":20},{"id":"shaodi-q-o117","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-d021e0b00f489a01f208","layer":"original","quote":"二年春二月〖1〗，青龙现温县井中。三月，司空卢毓薨。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":522,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26},{"id":"shaodi-q-o125","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-4d6508daae08a729a65a","layer":"original","quote":"甲子〖27〗，诏曰：“今车驾驻项〖28〗。大将军恭行天罚，前临淮浦〖29〗。昔相国、大司马征讨〖30〗，皆与尚书俱行〖31〗。今宜如旧。”乃令散骑常侍裴秀、给事黄门侍郎钟会咸与大将军俱行〖32〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":530,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":98},{"id":"wgc-q0028","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-c135ec113c597ad4f2da","layer":"original","quote":"六月，车驾东征，至项。大将军司马文王督中外诸军二十六万众，临淮讨之。大将军屯丘头，使基及安东将军陈骞等四面合围，表里再重〖9〗，堑垒甚峻。又使监军石苞、兖州刺史州泰等〖10〗，简锐卒为游军〖11〗，备外寇。钦等数出犯围〖12〗，逆击走之。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":175,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":119},{"id":"wgc-q0067","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-19a57525c37bf4f5767a","layer":"original","quote":"甘露二年，征诸葛诞为司空。时，会丧宁在家〖1〗，策诞必不从命，驰白文王。文王以事已施行，不复追改。﹝一﹞及诞反，车驾住项；文王至寿春，会复从行。初，吴大将全琮，孙权之婚亲重臣也〖2〗；琮子怿、孙静、从子端、翩、缉等，皆将兵来救诞。怿兄子辉、仪留建业，与其家内争讼；携其母，将部曲数十家渡江，自归文王。会建策，密为辉、仪作书，使辉、仪所亲信，赍入城告怿等，说“吴中怒怿等不能拔寿春，欲尽诛诸将家，故逃来归命”。怿等恐惧，遂将所领，开东城门出降，皆蒙封宠，城中由是乖离。寿春之破，会谋居多。亲待日隆，时人谓之子房〖3〗。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":455,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":258},{"id":"wgc-q0279","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-c135ec113c597ad4f2da","layer":"original","quote":"车驾东征，至项","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":175,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":3,"end":10},{"id":"wgc-q0433","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-19a57525c37bf4f5767a","layer":"original","quote":"及诞反，车驾住项；文王至寿春，会复从行","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":455,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":52,"end":71}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
